[en.IDEA_ALL_POLICE_STATE_2]
Police State

[en.IDEA_ALL_POLICE_STATE_2_desc]
This country is a police state, and secret police are watching the citizens of the country. They could be you, they could be me, and they could be 【CENSORED】.

[zh.IDEA_ALL_POLICE_STATE_2]
警察国家

[zh.IDEA_ALL_POLICE_STATE_2_desc]
这个国家是警察国家，秘密警察在暗中监视着国家的公民们。他们可能是你，也可能是我，也可能是【已和谐】。
